# Pinned Apple corecrypto drop that libgsa's SRP/crypto behavior was validated
# against. This is metadata ONLY — no Apple source is stored in this repo.
#
# - CORECRYPTO_URL is Apple's live "security" source bundle endpoint.
# - CORECRYPTO_SHA256 is the SHA-256 of the zip that produced the frozen golden
#   SRP vectors (tests/vectors/). When Apple silently revs corecrypto the SHA
#   changes; the scheduled "corecrypto-drift" workflow then opens an issue so a
#   maintainer can re-run the self-hosted behavioral differential.
#
# Updating the pin is a deliberate act: re-run the differential, refreeze the
# golden vectors, then bump CORECRYPTO_SHA256 here in the same commit.
CORECRYPTO_URL=https://developer.apple.com/file/?file=security&agree=Yes
CORECRYPTO_SHA256=b0f72ee1235ba791c302922c28be141a4806f7e13d1a1958a51f139d35ad64a9
